# Flint — environment template (devnet only).
#
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and adjust. Never commit real values, and
# never point this at mainnet: the build is devnet-only by design
# (FLINT_BUILD_CONTEXT.md Sections 6.3 and 12).
#
# Optional — leave unset to use the public devnet endpoint.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
